.TH TITANIUM 1
.SH NAME
titanium \- vertical scrolling shooter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/titanium
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Titanium
is a vertical scrolling shooter.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
A ship near the bottom fights downward-scrolling enemies. Move with wasd or the arrows; space fires.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Move
.TP
.B space
Fire
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/titanium.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
